 93:{common:summaries[93],
  pro:'Prepares each RFQ from your quote rule for you to send until you send one yourself and teach the rule. Then it sends matching RFQs and reminders on its own, up to your weekly number. A first request to a new supplier, Ask me first, Watch only, pause and the first 14 days keep it for you. Accepting a quote always needs you.',
  enterprise:'Sends RFQs and reminders from your quote rule on its own, without teaching, up to your weekly number. A first request to a new supplier, Ask me first, Watch only, pause and the first 14 days keep it for you. Accepting a quote always needs you.'},
